---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions - Balance Chemical Equation"
  description="Review the Terms and Conditions for using Balance Chemical Equation, our stoichiometry tools, and chemistry problem-solving platforms."
  currentPath="/terms-and-conditions"
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="relative py-8 sm:py-12 md:py-20 border-b border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Hero Mesh Glow -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 hero-mesh-gradient pointer-events-none opacity-60"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#8f8f8f] dark:text-[#737373] mb-4 sm:mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#171717] dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] font-medium">Terms & Conditions</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-[#171717] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#333333] text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono font-medium mb-4 shadow-[0px_1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)]">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-500 shrink-0"></span>
        <span>LAST UPDATED: NOVEMBER 2026</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-[28px] sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:tracking-[-1.5px] text-[#171717] dark:text-white leading-tight">
        Terms and Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 text-sm sm:text-lg text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed">
        Please read these Terms and Conditions carefully before using <strong>balancechemicalequation.com</strong>. By accessing or using our services, you agree to be bound by these terms.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16 space-y-8 sm:space-y-12 text-[14px] sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">
    <!-- 1. Agreement to Terms -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        1. Agreement to Terms
      </h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using our website located at <strong class="text-[#171717] dark:text-white">balancechemicalequation.com</strong>, including all associated web calculators, periodic table keypads, reaction libraries, and stoichiometric utilities (collectively, the "Service"), you agree to abide by and be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, you must discontinue use of the Service immediately.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. Permitted Use & Academic License -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        2. Permitted Use & Academic License
      </h2>
      <p>
        Balance Chemical Equation grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access and use our chemistry computation software for:
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Personal study, homework verification, and academic learning.</li>
        <li>Instruction, lecture demonstrations, and examination preparation in accredited educational institutions.</li>
        <li>Theoretical scientific modeling and preliminary chemistry laboratory calculations.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#8f8f8f] dark:text-[#737373]">
        You may freely print, cite, or share balanced chemical equations and stoichiometric steps produced by the Service with proper attribution to <code class="font-mono text-xs">balancechemicalequation.com</code>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Scientific Disclaimer & Lab Safety -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        3. Scientific Calculations Disclaimer & Laboratory Safety
      </h2>
      <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-[#171717] dark:text-white space-y-2">
        <div class="font-semibold text-sm flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">
          <span>⚠️</span> Important Chemistry & Safety Notice
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed">
          Our equation balancer uses exact Gaussian rational linear algebra and standard IUPAC atomic weights. However, balancing an equation represents theoretical conservation of mass and atoms. In the real world, chemical feasibility is governed by thermodynamics, reaction kinetics, activation energy, equilibrium constants, catalysts, and operating conditions (temperature, pressure).
        </p>
      </div>
      <p>
        The Service is intended strictly for computational and educational modeling. It does not replace certified professional laboratory safety protocols, Material Safety Data Sheets (MSDS/SDS), or industrial chemical process engineering reviews. Always wear appropriate personal protective equipment (PPE) and verify laboratory procedures with certified chemistry supervisors.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Acceptable Use -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        4. Prohibited Uses & Conduct
      </h2>
      <p>When accessing or using the Service, you agree not to:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Engage in any automated scraping, crawling, or denial-of-service attempts that degrade system stability for other users.</li>
        <li>Attempt to circumvent, reverse-engineer, or tamper with security or rate-limiting features.</li>
        <li>Use the Service for any unlawful activity or in violation of applicable national or international laws.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. Intellectual Property -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        5. Intellectual Property Rights
      </h2>
      <p>
        All original software code, UI design, periodic table layouts, branding, graphics, and explanatory chemistry literature on this website are the intellectual property of Balance Chemical Equation and are protected by applicable copyright and trademark laws.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. Disclaimer of Warranties -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        6. Disclaimer of Warranties
      </h2>
      <p>
        THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED ON AN "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" BASIS WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, ACCURACY, OR NON-INFRINGEMENT. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE SERVICE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, OR FREE OF HARMFUL COMPONENTS.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 7. Limitation of Liability -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        7. Limitation of Liability
      </h2>
      <p>
        TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, IN NO EVENT SHALL BALANCE CHEMICAL EQUATION, ITS AUTHORS, OR AFFILIATES BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, SPECIAL, OR EXEMPLARY DAMAGES ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH YOUR USE OR INABILITY TO USE THE SERVICE, INCLUDING ANY CHEMICAL ACCIDENTS, MISCALCULATIONS IN EXPERIMENTAL WORK, OR LOSS OF DATA.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 8. Modifications to Terms -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        8. Modifications to Terms
      </h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to revise or modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. When changes occur, the updated date at the top of this document will be amended. Your continued use of the website following any changes establishes your acceptance of the new terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- 9. Contact Information -->
    <section class="space-y-3 pt-4 border-t border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626]">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        9. Legal Inquiries & Questions
      </h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions or notices regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact our legal and administrative team at:
      </p>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#171717] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#2e2e2e] font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-1">
        <div>Email: <a href="mailto:legal@balancechemicalequation.com" class="text-[#0070f3] hover:underline break-all">legal@balancechemicalequation.com</a></div>
        <div>General Support: <a href="mailto:support@balancechemicalequation.com" class="text-[#0070f3] hover:underline break-all">support@balancechemicalequation.com</a></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

